.work-box
    .work-item
        .work-item__content
            //- 375 X 810 
            iframe(width="350" height="660" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/M7ZbCu-J3vA?si=zW1aoLbOf3fEjGKc" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen)
        .work-item__descrip
            .descrip__box
                .descrip__h2 Interactive UI
                .descrip__h3 ＿Puzzle Verification
                .descrip__txt Tool : Angular + Angular Material CDK + SVG
            .descrip__box
                .descrip__title ACHIEVEMENT
                ul.descrip__list
                    li Image Slicing: Used SVG and CSS to slice images into puzzle pieces and backgrounds, achieving precise and flexible puzzle effects.
                    li Drag and Drop: Implemented the drag-and-drop functionality for puzzle pieces using Angular Material CDK.
                    li Precision Calculation: Calculated whether puzzle pieces were accurately placed within the allowable error range and displayed success or failure messages accordingly.
                    li Event Listeners: Deployed to monitor the start, progress, and completion of the dragging events.

